                                "sense_id": "3dd9fb95-914f-34a7-9886-d2e9b16ee23c",
                                "text": "1920, Lillien Jane Martin, Mental hygiene: two years' experience of a clinical psychologist, Warwick &York (1920), p. 78,\n\"That part of mental hygiene which has a prophylactic character falls into two classes, group preventative mental hygiene […]\""
                            },
                            {
