                                "sense_id": "3dd9fb95-914f-34a7-9886-d2e9b16ee23c",
                                "text": "1968, G. Anthony Wedge, N. A. P.: New American Party, Geddes Press Printers (1968), p. 155,\n\"Preventative defense comes in two flavors […]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddf0c2a9-d45a-4bda-8616-788e56ce679c",
                                "sense_id": "3dd9fb95-914f-34a7-9886-d2e9b16ee23c",
                                "text": "2006, Robert Thompson and Barbara Fritchman Thompson, Repairing & Upgrading Your PC, O'Reilly (2006), p. 70,\n\"The goals of preventative maintenance are to reduce the likelihood of hardware failures, […]\""
                            }
                        ]
